# Phase 0 spike output — JSONL token streams, tens of MB per run.
spike/.spike-logs/

# Packaging staging + packager output. `out` is already ignored repo-wide, but
# being explicit here keeps the build products discoverable to a reader.
out/

# `iconutil` input only: 10 PNGs that make-icons.py regenerates and that carry no
# information `icon.icns` does not already hold. The .icns itself IS committed —
# packagers reference it directly, and building one should not require Python+PIL.
build/icon.iconset/
